    "detailed_description": "First person shooter. Light humor, dynamics and action will allow you to return to the atmosphere of first-person shooters of the 90s.<br>Intuitive first-person shooter in the classic tradition of the genre.<br>It is not necessary to know languages \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200band read a lot of text, just go and destroy everything around.<br>Throwing knives, grenades, bombs and a whole arsenal of small arms will help you have fun and achieve any goal.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/806a2dc2c796efb0a93174d08edeee02.avif?t=1740650557\" /></div><br>At any time, you can always improve the properties of your weapon. Increase power, put a laser sight and other modules.<br><br>Near the fire extinguisher you will often find something to replenish your health.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/78f27d81f7dc7fb521df9742612b750f.avif?t=1740650557\" /></div><br><br>By pressing the Esc (pause) button during the game you will see a list of all control buttons and change the graphics settings.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/110b7a34dfe1893af00bc8fb763b3abc.avif?t=1740650557\" /></div><br>Controls.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/986076303f20701dee0cad32480daf27.avif?t=1740650557\" /></div><br><br>And a little background.<br><br>A mercenary army financed by a group of hostile nations under the command of a fugitive general Jonathan Badon <br>captured the Allied military base on one of the islands in the Pacific Ocean.<br>Experiments with biological weapons are being carried out there, the purpose of which is the destruction of our country and allied states.<br>We have selected the best of the best to participate in the operation to regain control of the base.<br>We must recapture the base at any cost.<br>You and your group act immediately.<br>Your goal is to destroy the enemy manpower and regain control over the island.<br>Code name for Operation &quot;Mobilization&quot;.<br>Good luck.",
