d allied states.<br>We have selected the best of the best to participate in the operation to regain control of the base.<br>We must recapture the base at any cost.<br>You and your group act immediately.<br>Your goal is to destroy the enemy manpower and regain control over the island.<br>Code name for Operation &quot;Mobilization&quot;.<br>Good luck.",
